.TH std::mersenne_twister_engine::max 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::mersenne_twister_engine::max \- std::mersenne_twister_engine::max

.SH Synopsis
static constexpr result_type max();  \fI(since C++11)\fP

Returns the maximum value potentially generated by the random-number engine.

.SH Return value

\\(\\scriptsize 2^w-1 \\)2w
-1

.SH Complexity

Constant.

.SH See also

min      gets the smallest possible value in the output range
